# Overview only: each workspace has its own example to copy to .env.local.
#   backend/api/.env.example      SUPABASE_URL, SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY, CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS
#                                 (+ optional, server-only: account deletion and reflection workers)
#   frontend/web/.env.example     NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL, NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY, NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL
#   frontend/mobile/.env.example  EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL, EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY, EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL
#   ai/ (later)                   AI provider settings live only in the AI service.
# Clients only ever get public values. Never put admin keys, trigger secrets or AI tokens in a frontend.
# See docs/deployment.md for the hosted values and docs/ai-service.md for AI variables.
